From c61452be285c5514cc722e92d0899deb22ef9815 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Coliseu Sistemas <coliseu.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Apr 2026 14:36:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(branches): implement full multi-tenant branch
 isolation architecture

- Identity: add Branch entity, migration, BranchesController (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE)
  and IBranchRepository; expose internal endpoint GET /branches for Worker
- Middleware: add branches router (GET /api/branches), SQL migration 011,
  inject X-Branch-Id validation in auth middleware
- Worker: SyncOrdersJob writes ID_DEPTO/ID_PORTADOR per branch on Firebird;
  SyncCatalogJob enriches each product with erpDeptoPadrao from default branch;
  SyncSalesRankingsJob/SyncCatalogJob filter sellers by ID_EMPRESA per branch;
  IdentityApiClient adds GetBranchesAsync; SyncSalesRankingsJob gains IOptions using
- Mobile v1.9.0+41: AppConfigService stores branchId/branchName; JwtInterceptor
  sends X-Branch-Id header; BranchSelectionScreen added with auto-select logic;
  login_screen redirects to branch selection if not configured; database_helper
  v33 migration adds erp_depto_padrao column to products; SyncService maps field
- Configurator: bump version 1.7.9 -> 1.8.0
